  m_text: 'In this game, you play as a giant pair of fingers protecting a poor soul
    trapped in their home all while being overrun by zombies.


    You must tap,
    swipe, and shake your device to kill the zombies before they get to the Poor
    Soul. If the Poor Soul gets attacked too much, they will die and you lose! Survive
    until your thumbs fall off!

'
